<% content_for :title, "Dance" %>
<% content_for :description, "Annie Walsh dances in London: selected performances including Walk with Amal, the Platinum Jubilee Pageant and the UEFA Champions League Final kick-off show, plus teaching at Uptop Dance School." %>

<header class="wrap site-header">
  <%= link_to "Annie Walsh", root_path, class: "site-header__name" %>
  <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Dance">
    <a href="#performances">Performances</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    <%= link_to "Code →", code_path, class: "pill pill--sm pill--blue" %>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="wrap--tight">
    <div class="panel dance-hero">
      <span class="shape" aria-hidden="true" style="left: -100px; top: -100px; width: 340px; height: 340px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange);"></span>
      <span class="shape" aria-hidden="true" style="right: 80px; bottom: -60px; width: 300px; height: 150px; border-radius: 300px 300px 0 0; background: var(--lilac);"></span>

      <div class="dance-hero__text">
        <span class="dance-hero__lead">when I’m not coding, I’m</span>
        <h1>dancing.</h1>
        <p>Dance has always been a huge part of my life. The stage is where I feel most alive. Here are some of my favourite performances in London.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="collage" aria-hidden="true">
        <%= image_tag "two_worlds/uefa.jpg", alt: "", class: "collage__a" %>
        <%= image_tag "two_worlds/jubilee.jpg", alt: "", class: "collage__b" %>
        <%= image_tag "two_worlds/amal.jpg", alt: "", class: "collage__c" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="performances" class="wrap performances">
    <h2 class="display h-section">Selected <span class="serif" style="color: var(--rose-deep);">events</span></h2>

    <article class="perf">
      <%= image_tag "two_worlds/amal-2.jpg", alt: "Mass dance performance for Little Amal in London", class: "perf__img" %>
      <div class="perf__card" style="background: var(--orange);">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size: 14px;">Good Chance Theatre · Trafalgar Square</span>
        <div>
          <h3><%= link_to "The Walk (Little Amal)", "https://www.walkwithamal.org/", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %></h3>
          <p>Little Amal, a giant puppet by Handspring Puppet Company, has travelled over 8,000km for displaced children. For her 10th birthday in London, 50+ volunteers rehearsed for four weeks. Choreography by Kenrick ‘H2O’ Sandy, music by Michael ‘Mikey J’ Asante.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="perf perf--flip">
      <div class="perf__card" style="background: var(--yellow);">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size: 14px;">Boy Blue · Buckingham Palace</span>
        <div>
          <h3><%= link_to "Platinum Jubilee Pageant", "https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.onething.org/video/Boy+Blue+-+Stage.mp4", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %></h3>
          <p>The celebration of 70 years since Elizabeth II’s accession. A once-in-a-lifetime chance to perform with one of the UK’s most celebrated hip hop dance companies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <%= image_tag "two_worlds/jubilee.jpg", alt: "Performers at the Platinum Jubilee Pageant", class: "perf__img" %>
    </article>

    <article class="perf">
      <%= image_tag "two_worlds/uefa.jpg", alt: "Stadium performance at the UEFA Champions League Final kick-off show", class: "perf__img" %>
      <div class="perf__card" style="background: var(--lilac);">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size: 14px;">Fatima Robinson · Wembley Stadium</span>
        <div>
          <h3><%= link_to "UEFA Champions League Final", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7V6p8G0BRCw", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %></h3>
          <p>Rock icon Lenny Kravitz headlined an unforgettable performance in London at the UEFA Champions League Final Kick Off Show presented by Pepsi.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="perf perf--flip">
      <div class="perf__card" style="background: var(--pink);">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size: 14px;">Teaching · Uptop Dance School</span>
        <div>
          <h3><%= link_to "Children's Instructor & Choreographer", "https://youtu.be/EqeQYKM5Iv8?si=oXnI05S-lLjNgogg&t=200", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %></h3>
          <p> I led two weekly hip-hop classes for dancers ages <span style="white-space: nowrap;">4–5</span> and <span style="white-space: nowrap;">6–9</span>, building their foundational skills and choreographing original routines for the end-of-year recital. I also helped facilitate and lead a high-energy flash mob featuring the entire school. </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="perf__img" aria-hidden="true">
       <%= image_tag "two_worlds/dance_teacher.jpg", alt: "teaching at the Uptop Dance School end of year performance", class: "perf__img" %>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="wrap--tight" style="padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 16px;">
    <div class="panel dark-cta">
      <span class="shape" aria-hidden="true" style="right: -90px; top: -90px; width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--rose);"></span>
      <div class="dark-cta__text">
        <h2 class="display">Dance <span class="serif" style="color: var(--yellow);">and</span> code?</h2>
        <p>It’s a rare mix, and I’d love to use it. If you’re making a performance that needs a digital side, or a digital project that needs to move, let’s talk.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <%= link_to "Let’s talk", linkedin_url, class: "pill pill--outline-light", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", aria: { label: "Let’s talk on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)" } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="wrap site-footer">
  <%= link_to "← Home", root_path %>
  <%= link_to "Over on the other side: Code →", code_path %>
  <span>© <%= Date.current.year %> Annie Walsh</span>
</footer>
